+    ``ivtc`` behaves like ``auto``, except that interlaced video at 29.97 or
+    30 fps gets inverse telecine instead: the lavfi ``fieldmatch`` filter
+    rebuilds 3:2 telecined film frames from their fields, ``bwdif``
+    deinterlaces the frames that cannot be matched, and ``decimate`` drops the
